{"data": [{"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:41:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116284394621001997"], "id": "2116284394621001997", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 32, "impression_count": 25332, "like_count": 59, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "What Being in the Market Means\nRational Dissent Episode 015\n\nThis week's episode unpacks what it really means to be \"in the market\"—breaking down active versus passive investing in stocks and bonds and explaining why overly optimistic return expectations can lead to a painful https://t.co/sI4SqQpdBi", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2116284394621001997"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:09:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116276357579882842"], "id": "2116276357579882842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 20525, "like_count": 113, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 17}, "text": "Employment Cost Index (ECI), which measures changes in wages/salaries and benefits, rose 0.8% in 3Q26 vs. 0.9% in 2Q26 … labor costs advanced 3.4% on a year/year basis, but trailed headline CPI inflation, which grew 3.7% in September https://t.co/pptfoaMQKD", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2116276357579882842"}, {"author_id": "3039504459", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:27:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116265650754638258"], "id": "2116265650754638258", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 2139, "like_count": 26, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "#OnTheCover of this week’s issue: Self-synchronized dual-color free-electron-laser generation driven by a single prebunched electron beam. Blue: soft X-ray pulses; magenta: long-wavelength mid-infrared radiation.\n\nCheck out the complete issue: https://t.co/H3Je6ZaohB https://t.co/zs7E9AtESg", "url": "https://x.com/PhysRevLett/status/2116265650754638258"}, {"author_id": "14096763